        "significance": 0.0,
        "start_tick": 30.0,
        "text": "In a matter of days, the campaign at the Barwyn, held by the Free Cities ground toward what the dispatches would call a mixed result \u2014 a conclusion that satisfied no one completely. At the Barwyn, the terms of a mixed result were ratified under a sky that offered no comment. The people who had lived through the campaign signed where they were told to sign."
      },
      {
        "category": 3.0,
        "cluster_type": 0.0,
        "end_tick": 80.0,
        "expanded_mentions": [
          {
            "id": 76.0,
