          },
          {
            "id": 64.0,
            "kind": "region",
            "len": 11.0,
            "start": 341.0
          }
        ],
        "expanded_text": "The chronicles of the Rasvane, held by the Northwind Host offer little drama for this stretch \u2014 which is, in its own way, a kind of record. Local governance in the Rasvane functioned within its ordinary tolerances. Disputes were resolved at the local level; appeals to higher authority were rare and, when made, largely procedural. In this, the Rasvane was useful \u2014 not as a subject of history, but as a foundation beneath it.",
        "fragment": 288.0,
        "fragment_ids": [
          288.0,
          297.0,
          299.0
        ],
        "id": 6.0,
