        "significance": 5.2,
        "start_tick": 30.0,
        "text": "The chronicles of the Rasvane, held by the Northwind Host offer little drama for this stretch \u2014 which is, in its own way, a kind of record. Local governance in the Rasvane functioned within its ordinary tolerances. Disputes were resolved at the local level; appeals to higher authority were rare and, when made, largely procedural."
      },
      {
        "category": 22.0,
        "cluster_type": 3.0,
        "end_tick": 80.0,
        "expanded_mentions": [
          {
            "id": 64.0,
            "kind": "region",
            "len": 11.0,
            "start": 41.0
